  epo:definesReviewer <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/9a6e4280-6ead-4b15-867d-a7575a623495-01/Reviewer/ORG-0003organization> .

<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/9a6e4280-6ead-4b15-867d-a7575a623495-01/ReviewTerm$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot2_TenderingTerms1_AppealTerms1_PresentationPeriod1>
